    <node id="Robotic Arm">
      <data key="d0">Robotic Arm</data>
      <data key="d1">tool</data>
      <data key="d2">"A mechanical device for simulating human arm movements."&lt;SEP&gt;The Robotic Arm is a sophisticated mechanical device designed to mimic human arm motions for a variety of tasks. Characterized by its blue and white design, this advanced manipulator features an articulated structure that allows for precise and programmable operations across multiple applications. It includes a beige gripper at the end, enhancing its ability to interact effectively with objects.

This versatile robotic arm operates either autonomously or under remote control, making it suitable for a range of environments. It demonstrates particular utility in domestic settings, such as kitchens, where it can automate intricate culinary processes, as well as in industrial contexts, where it significantly improves efficiency in labor-intensive tasks.

In summary, the Robotic Arm represents a notable advancement in automation technology, serving as an essential tool in both household and industrial applications. Its continuous evolution highlights the growing capabilities of robotics to meet diverse operational needs.&lt;SEP&gt;"A mechanical device used for manipulating objects, capable of picking and placing.""</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be programmed to perform tasks;"Can interact with and manipulate objects in the environment.";"Can lift;"Can move;"Can pick up;"Can pick up or interact with objects.";"Manipulate;"Move;"N/A";"automated tasks;"can grasp;"can pick up;"can_grasp;"can_reach;"capable of movement and manipulation of objects";"grasp;"grasping;"hold;"lifting;"lifting or assembling items;"manipulate;"manipulate objects;"manipulate objects";"manipulate";"move;"pick up;"pick_up;"picking up objects;"potentially used for reaching or manipulating objects";"precise movement;"program to move;"reach;and place objects;assemble;assembly;assembly";assist in tasks;capable of movement and handling objects.";capable of navigating";coordinate tasks";experiment";grasp;grip;grip";inspect";interact with objects";interact with various objects";interact";lift;manipulate;manipulate objects;manipulate objects";manipulate";manipulate_objects;manipulate_objects";manipulating items";mechanical tasks";move;move objects";moving;moving objects;often programmed to execute specific tasks.";often_used_in_culinary_automation";perform tasks;perform tasks";pick up;place objects;place";position objects;position objects";positioning";programmable for specific functions";programmable functions";reach distant areas";releasing objects";rotate;shift";support;transport";useful in automated tasks."</data>
      <data key="d4">"Limited by its range of motion;"Limited by programming and operational range";"May require specific programming;"N/A";"Requires a powered source;"Requires proper programming for effective navigation and object manipulation.";"limited_by_programming;"movement_restricted_by_design";"must confirm presence and accessibility of objects before interaction;"operate_within_program_limits;"requires power source;"requires_precise_programming;"requires_programming;avoid hazardous_conditions_without_safeguards";interact_with_securely_grasped_objects;limited by its physical range and capabilities.";may require programmed instructions to complete tasks.";may_have_limits_on_weight_and_reach";may_have_operational_limits_based_on_payload";mechanical_range";mechanical_range_of_motion";operable within some weight limits;operational limits depend on the design and surrounding obstacles.";operational_limits";potential hazards if not managed carefully";potential hazards";stationary when not in use";weight limits</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The Robotic Arm is currently at rest but possesses significant capabilities for active engagement and task performance. Despite several descriptions of its features being marked as "N/A," the Robotic Arm is acknowledged for its effectiveness in executing a variety of tasks and its ability to dynamically interact with its environment. This highlights the Robotic Arm's versatility and potential for use across multiple applications. It is recognized for its readiness to initiate active involvement whenever required, and it has been observed just before interaction, underscoring its responsive nature in preparation for engagement.</data>
      <data key="d6">"Foreground on the right side of the image, positioned over a wooden table."'&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm is prominently located in the upper right corner of a kitchen environment, positioned on a metallic base atop a wooden countertop. It is situated in the foreground of the image, where it extends towards a nearby wooden cabinet and hovers slightly above the surface of the countertop. Currently inactive, the arm is angled to facilitate interaction with a small gray object located nearby, illustrating its functional purpose in manipulating items within the kitchen setting. Additionally, part of the arm is visible as it reaches towards a sphere placed on a light brown wooden table at the edge of the image, further emphasizing its capability for object manipulation in various contexts. This setup effectively showcases the robotic arm's strategic position and potential for engaging with objects in its workspace.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Robotic Arm is a sophisticated mechanical device primarily designed for the automation and manipulation of various objects in both industrial and domestic settings. It features a visually striking blue body with gray, tan, and white accents, complemented by a metallic base. The gray gripper enhances its ability to interact effectively with tools and items.

This versatile device is commonly found in practical environments, such as kitchens, where it is strategically mounted on light wood counters, walls, or other vertical surfaces. The Robotic Arm often extends partially into workspaces, optimizing interactions and streamlining intricate tasks. Its articulated joints provide the necessary flexibility and dexterity for precision tasks such as sorting, assembly, and cooking, which significantly enhances efficiency, particularly in food preparation processes.

Constructed from durable materials like metal and plastic, the Robotic Arm is robust, programmable, and designed for precise control, allowing it to adapt to a range of applications—from household chores to robotics experimentation. Additionally, it is typically situated near other household items, such as bicycles, and on wooden floors, further indicating its integration into everyday environments, where it serves as an essential tool for enhancing productivity and automating daily tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm is primarily blue with white and gray accents and is designed for mechanical or interactive tasks within an environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm operates above the wooden counter/table, designed to assist in tasks such as moving the spatula within the kitchen setting.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-9ea89f38157afd644646161baf34ee5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-614a3c230561eadf10b09794a56e621d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930680ee429708b5bdbd45cefca76bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a745bba3d72a571b8996b0d30c3665d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b9127cb8869d5c709f19137c59cad00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d666c4bf536228600a4ed107a3ebf70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38894c7d6a32f3a52f4c9b5cce45070b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e94a5733ff2fdd221132113047095ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb06cb8163e6217b939755ccec2c89e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab86b7132754853eef18d18781642fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b6b9ba843c2fede51e4e70a52abeeaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23be772a58e9576e74877efc6f4379dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbba0c6e496c03aad842a98f0fe40004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d75c7d20d6fed359f53d074a308256af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23058c0c542049bef4ee516d0a35775c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f172317a5843d2e8c63b1d12a3baf26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb7a831efc1c1e0693a959b45bd26ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ea7f411d585e076b9d1a6c98ffab476&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce22e3f57d781d2bd14b02fff245c4be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de39f2938144157f07000d83e203588d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9b13bc6081e4cc0667d993c59416508&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efd3fa72187571ca78c00b47e8f02c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4363e14d2f9044c6b54d29b7354926&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8af5c3b71e3e01328ef854c0f92d2b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02783998490e77e8325f8aeba6eb94fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c1d3449bf2ad39f130ad4bffb29c9b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-011f437f9050a7a6195621b222da53b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa39d8a958f3e4db844fd75c07817726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-340d39930d16d13626f3a664af3b74ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed05e95e0946e9a3d352e36c1a0d4d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f145b0025550723dcbb39af598f17dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d72875c7f15f9a08e03bb13f0f5fdb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a64e5bfa95f10178da5d6f211fafa8a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6ca8ab54ad07b4aa85bbe3e869e2107&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6366bae3946c6ac207bc3e435931da</data>
