    <node id="Exercise Ball">
      <data key="d0">Exercise Ball</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Exercise Ball is a large, spherical object made of rubber, designed for a variety of fitness activities. It is an inflatable ball commonly utilized in exercise routines and physical therapy, serving as a versatile tool to enhance physical fitness. Often noted for its size and shape, the Exercise Ball can also function as casual seating, with some variants being described as dark gray in color. This multifaceted equipment is favored in both gym settings and therapeutic environments for its effectiveness in improving balance, stability, and core strength.</data>
      <data key="d3">"bounce;"sit;"use for fitness;exercise;exercise";provide seating";roll;sit;stretch"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The Exercise Ball is positioned within the room, specifically located on a light gray rug in the center of the image. It is situated center-left, adjacent to a robotic arm and a wooden table, suggesting its availability for use.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Exercise Ball is a large, dark gray fitness tool that serves multiple purposes, including exercise and alternative seating options. It is incorporated into the environment as a key fitness tool, specifically designed for physical exercises or rehabilitation. The Exercise Ball is commonly used for various fitness and exercise activities, highlighting its versatility and functionality in promoting physical well-being.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-de39f2938144157f07000d83e203588d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d75c7d20d6fed359f53d074a308256af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02783998490e77e8325f8aeba6eb94fc</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
