    </node>
    <node id="Sofa">
      <data key="d0">Sofa</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sofa is a blocky, modern-designed piece of upholstered furniture specifically created for seating multiple people. It is typically comfortable and suitable for socializing, making it an essential component of relaxation areas such as living rooms. This versatile furniture item serves as a comfortable seating option, providing a defined space for sitting and often accommodating several users. Overall, the sofa stands out as a large and functional fixture that enhances social interactions and relaxation in various settings.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"provide seating";"provides seating;"sit;can be sat upon";lounging;recline;relax";rest";socializing"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Mid-background of the image, positioned to the right side of the bicycle."'&lt;SEP&gt;The sofa is positioned within the room, serving as a seating option. It is situated against the wall, with a green leafy plant placed behind it.</data>
      <data key="d7">The sofa is a blocky, modern piece of furniture that serves as a fundamental element in living rooms, designed to seat multiple people comfortably. It plays a significant role in the overall layout of the room, offering a comfortable seating option that enhances both relaxation and socialization within a multifunctional living space. The large gray sofa features cushioned seats and armrests, providing ample seating space for occupants. Historically, the sofa was associated with a plum, indicating its original use as a seating area in this specific living space before that item was relocated. Overall, the sofa remains an essential and comfortable fixture, contributing positively to the home's environment.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-3b8da8fc45801180e1d16b51902f2efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de39f2938144157f07000d83e203588d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d75c7d20d6fed359f53d074a308256af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d3cfff65d9a45c2ba137c3a5c73e52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02783998490e77e8325f8aeba6eb94fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1aa7753b1ea87318024ca3d978c954a</data>
