      <data key="d2">"Fruit, sphere shape, red color."&lt;SEP&gt;The Red Apple is a small, roughly spherical fruit known for its bright red color and sweet taste. This fresh, round, and shiny fruit is commonly consumed raw or used in cooking, making it a popular choice among various fruits. Its vibrant appearance enhances its appeal, and it is often described as sweet and refreshing. The Red Apple is characterized by its small size and delightful flavor, making it a favorite addition to meals and snacks alike.</data>
