      <data key="d0">Blue Robotic Arm</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Blue Robotic Arm is a sophisticated mechanical device designed for performing tasks primarily in a kitchen environment. It features a striking blue color with a white stripe and metallic components, indicative of industrial design. The arm's segmented structure highlights its versatility and practical application, allowing it to effectively interact with various objects through its metallic gripping end. This combination of functionality and style makes the Blue Robotic Arm an advanced tool suitable for both industrial and domestic use, showcasing its ability to perform complex tasks while maintaining an aesthetic appeal. Overall, the Blue Robotic Arm is characterized by its distinctive blue and white accents and a design that emphasizes interaction and functionality.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can manipulate objects;"Can move;"can move and interact with objects";"can move items;"extend;"interaction;"move;assist in tasks";functionality";grasp";grip;interact with objects";interact with objects.";move;perform tasks"</data>
