    <node id="Wooden Table">
      <data key="d0">Wooden Table</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">"A rectangular piece of furniture made from wood."&lt;SEP&gt;The Wooden Table is a versatile piece of furniture primarily constructed from wood, characterized by its light to medium brown color and smooth surface. Typically designed in a rectangular shape, this table serves multiple functional purposes, such as dining and working, and is frequently utilized in kitchen settings. Notably, it features a shelf-like structure beneath the surface, with at least two shelves providing additional storage. This Wooden Table combines aesthetic appeal with practicality, making it a common and useful element in various indoor spaces. Its sturdy legs ensure durability, supporting a flat surface that enhances its functionality.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be used for placing objects;"Can hold items;"can be used for placing items or as a surface for various tasks";"place objects;"place_objects;"serve;"support objects;"surfaces can hold items;be used for storage";can be cleaned or decorated.";dining;display";eat";gather people around.";or other activities requiring a flat surface.";provide a surface for food preparation;serve as a workspace;use as workspace;use_as_workspace</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"keep_away_from_moisture;weight_limit"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Foreground, on the right side of the image, used for placement of items and mechanical devices."'&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"positioned on the right side of the image, with a robotic arm mounted on it."</data>
      <data key="d7">The Wooden Table is a medium to light brown, rectangular piece of furniture that plays a central role in the kitchen environment, effectively located near the kitchen cabinets and positioned on the right side of the hallway. It serves as a versatile and functional surface for a variety of activities, including food preparation, dining, working, and displaying or serving items. With its smooth surface and sturdy legs, the Wooden Table provides a flat area for placing various objects and supports tasks such as manipulation by a robotic arm. Overall, it is a common and essential fixture in indoor settings, contributing to both practical functions and as a focal point in the room's layout.&lt;SEP&gt;The wooden table is sturdy with a natural finish, featuring two shelves.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-62629e63a5044798425e4efed8673811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a745bba3d72a571b8996b0d30c3665d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d666c4bf536228600a4ed107a3ebf70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d75c7d20d6fed359f53d074a308256af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23058c0c542049bef4ee516d0a35775c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02783998490e77e8325f8aeba6eb94fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab86b7132754853eef18d18781642fa9</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d10">1772788748</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Green Apple">
      <data key="d0">Green Apple</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">"Small spherical fruit that is green in color."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Green Apple is a round fruit known for its tart flavor and smooth green skin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type of fruit known for its tart flavor and green skin."</data>
      <data key="d3">"can be grasped;"can_be_eaten_raw;"eat_raw;cook;juice";juiced";moved";used_in_cooking</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Global position: On the brown table, alongside the yellow apple; Local relations: N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Green Apple is a type of fruit recognized for its tartness and is commonly found in various culinary applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Apple is round with smooth green skin and is known for its tart flavor; it can be eaten raw, cooked, or juiced.&lt;SEP&gt;The green apple is another specific piece of fruit similar to the yellow apple but distinguished by its green color.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-9406bec563767678ffbc7927450b1f00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a745bba3d72a571b8996b0d30c3665d7</data>
