    <node id="Kitchen Environment">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen Environment</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kitchen Environment is an area specifically designed for cooking and food preparation. It is equipped with various appliances, utensils, and food items, providing the necessary tools for meal preparation. This space not only serves a functional purpose but may also incorporate decorative elements, enhancing its aesthetic appeal. Overall, the Kitchen Environment is essential for culinary activities, combining practicality with style.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can facilitate cooking;"cooking;"supports cooking and household activities";and food storage activities.";cleaning;food preparation"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"keep clean;"keep_clean;do not leave food out";do_not_leave_food_out"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Center of the kitchen around the sink, with specific items positioned around it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Global position is the central area within the household; connected to living areas and adjacent structures like stairs and a bicycle area."</data>
      <data key="d7">The Kitchen Environment is a modern space designed for food-related activities, centered around the sink and showcasing a variety of kitchen items essential for cooking and food preparation. This setting includes functional components such as cabinetry, appliances, and designated workspace areas. It features a right counter adorned with various items, a left counter with a bowl, and a wooden table positioned in the center, all of which contribute to its typical kitchen atmosphere. Additionally, the environment highlights an assortment of kitchenware, fruits, and mechanical components, exemplifying a well-equipped area for culinary endeavors.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-1d72875c7f15f9a08e03bb13f0f5fdb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23058c0c542049bef4ee516d0a35775c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24d776ee39f9dcc371595a6de50cd5d7</data>
