      <data key="d2">"A hand tool used for turning screws."&lt;SEP&gt;The Screwdriver is a hand tool designed for driving screws into various materials. It features a blue handle and a metallic shaft, making it a practical and visually appealing tool. This hand-held implement is versatile and can be used in various settings, including kitchens, for tightening or loosening screws.</data>
