      <data key="d7">Initially located on the sofa, the screwdriver was moved to the right receptacle of the left counter for functional use.&lt;SEP&gt;The Screwdriver is a hand tool that consists of a shaft and a tip, which are specifically designed to fit into the notch of screws. Its primary function is to drive screws into materials or remove them, making it an essential tool for various applications, particularly in kitchen tasks. Classified as a practical hand tool, the screwdriver is integral for tightening or loosening screws, thereby facilitating numerous tasks in a kitchen setting and beyond.</data>
