    <node id="Kitchen Counter">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen Counter</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">"A flat work surface typically used for food preparation and storage in the kitchen."&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen Counter is a flat surface commonly found in kitchens, designed primarily for food preparation and the arrangement of kitchen items. It serves as a typical working surface where various tasks, such as meal prep and placement of cooking tools, are performed. This essential element of the kitchen facilitates both functionality and organization in culinary activities.</data>
