      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">Part of the kitchen area, the kitchen counter includes drawers and cabinets for organization, facilitating cooking and meal preparations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen Counter is a functional surface located in the kitchen, serving as the primary workspace for cooking and food preparation. It is often situated adjacent to the sink and is designed to support various kitchen tools and objects. The kitchen counter functions as the main area for numerous kitchen activities, including the organization and placement of items used in food preparation and other tasks. Overall, it plays a crucial role in facilitating efficient workflow and organization within the kitchen environment.</data>
