    <node id="Red Bicycle">
      <data key="d0">Red Bicycle</data>
      <data key="d1">vehicle</data>
      <data key="d2">"A two-wheeled vehicle with a red frame, used for transport or recreation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Two-wheeled vehicle for transportation"&lt;SEP&gt;The Red Bicycle is a human-powered vehicle characterized by its two wheels and distinctive red color. It serves as a means of transportation, featuring a red frame complemented by two black-tired wheels. The bicycle is equipped with handlebars for steering and a seat for the rider, allowing for a comfortable and efficient riding experience powered by pedaling.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be ridden;"Can be ridden for transport;"can be ridden;"human transport;adjusted for height.";can be parked or stored.";can be parked";can be used for exercise;exercise;maneuvered";parked;providing exercise and leisure opportunities";recreation"</data>
      <data key="d4">"May require maintenance for safety;"N/A";"Suitable for outdoor use;"must be parked upright;may require maintenance";requires balance to ride.";size can limit use for children."</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Global position: foreground, left side of the room; Local relations: against a beige wall."&lt;SEP&gt;"Positioned near the center and back of the scene, facing the viewer."&lt;SEP&gt;"left portion of the image; standing upright next to a light-colored wall"</data>
      <data key="d7">Situated in the midground, it is positioned against dark-colored vertical panels.&lt;SEP&gt;The Red Bicycle is a vivid and striking stationary bicycle, prominently positioned in the back left corner of the image, adjacent to a grey sofa within a designated seating area. It features a red frame, characterized by two wheels and standard configurations of handlebars. This bicycle is intended for both transportation and recreation, making it a versatile piece of equipment. On the left side of the scene, it is also noted for its black handlebars, further complementing its vivid red design.&lt;SEP&gt;The Red Bicycle is an upright two-wheeled vehicle situated near a light-colored wall, ready for use.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-23be772a58e9576e74877efc6f4379dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbba0c6e496c03aad842a98f0fe40004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e4ce2fb27de69f40d181ffa114e97cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6ca8ab54ad07b4aa85bbe3e869e2107&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb06cb8163e6217b939755ccec2c89e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce22e3f57d781d2bd14b02fff245c4be</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
