    <node id="Strawberry">
      <data key="d0">Strawberry</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">"A berry, typically red in color, with a conical shape and small seeds on its surface."&lt;SEP&gt;"A soft, red fruit that typically has a sweet taste and is characterized by tiny seeds on its surface."</data>
