      <data key="d6">"Initially located on the right counter in a kitchen environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Located on the left counter towards the center of the image; positioned openly on the surface of the left counter."</data>
      <data key="d7">A strawberry is a sweet, red fruit known for its distinctive flavor and is often associated with various culinary uses and health benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;The Strawberry is a red fruit known for its sweet flavor, often used in desserts and salads, with specific details on its properties and care.</data>
