      <data key="d6">"initially located on table 1; visibility in final scene not confirmed"&lt;SEP&gt;"located on a blue table in an indoor setting, near a wooden cabinet on the right side"</data>
      <data key="d7">A padlock is a portable locking mechanism used to secure items or areas, made of metal with a shackle to lock and unlock.&lt;SEP&gt;The padlock is a portable locking device primarily used for securing various items. It features a shackle that snaps into place and can only be opened with the correct key or code, ensuring protection against unauthorized access.</data>
