    <edge source="Red Apple" target="Black Spatula">
      <data key="d11">31.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The Black Spatula is a versatile kitchen tool that can be utilized for various culinary tasks, particularly in relation to the Red Apple. It can serve or flip the Red Apple when it is placed on the Tabletop, making it an essential utensil for handling the fruit. Additionally, the Black Spatula is effective for serving the Red Apple after it has been sliced, facilitating easy presentation for consumption. Its applications extend to interacting with the Red Apple during the cooking process and plating, thus enhancing its overall utility in preparing the fruit for various dishes.&lt;SEP&gt;The spatula may be used in conjunction with the apple during cooking or food preparation, indicating a use scenario in the kitchen.</data>
      <data key="d13">cooking,culinary use,food interaction,food preparation;kitchen,food service,kitchen use;food preparation,preparation,utensil usage</data>
